# منصة واحدة — Next.js في جذر المستودع

The production app is `src/` (Next.js App Router, hoisted from mkn-theme). Legacy HTML/CJS has been removed.

## Do

- New features, APIs, admin UI, booking, WhatsApp, ZATCA, auth, licenses → `src/`
- Shared crypto/OTP stays in `supabase/functions/`
- Schemas stay in `db/` only if a Next route will use them

## Do not

- Do not recreate `admin.html`, `js/admin*.js`, or Vercel CJS `api/*.js`
- Do not create `*-redirect.html` bridges
- Do not migrate 3PL / BNPL / ISO 20022 / franchise SQL into the app
